      "description": "Check whether a named doctor or department is working on 'today' or a confirmed YYYY-MM-DD date. Use for availability or working hours; for symptoms without a chosen department, use search_knowledge first. Ask the caller to choose when ambiguous. Speak the live board status per session: IN, LATE with expectedTime, CANCELLED, NOT_CONFIRMED or UNKNOWN; usual hours are not attendance. CALLBACK_REQUIRED: stop scheduling, ask only for name and callback number, say someone from the hospital will call back; summary only, no booking, transfer or alternatives.",
