      "description": "Answer hospital questions and find a department for the caller's symptoms. Pass question verbatim, untranslated and unsummarised (maximum 500 characters; never truncate). Not for doctor availability or appointments. Speak approved answer.text and routing.speak.text exactly as returned. TRANSFER_EMERGENCY: transfer immediately, stop scheduling. CHECK_AVAILABILITY: use the returned department in get_doctor_availability; CLARIFICATION_NEEDED: ask the returned question. NO_ANSWER: offer the desk; COULD_NOT_CHECK is a service failure, not a negative answer.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "language": {
            "description": "The language the caller is speaking.",
            "maxLength": 16,
            "type": "string"
